        "POPCORN_LEE_HYPERREAL_BODY_ULTIMATE_DOMAIN_DESCRIPTION": "Dissolve <style=cIsUtility>[Hypermatricem]</style>, fiens invulnerabilis pro brevi tempore et infligens <style=cIsDamage>1500% vulneris</style> in tuo transitu. Adde 3 ictus <style=cIsDamage>200% vulneris</style> quoties uteris <style=cIsUtility>[3-coniunctione]</style> in hypermatrice. Ad summum 4 vicibus pro 12 additis ictibus.",
